## About Protect

Protect collects the measures intended to prevent incidents or limit their scope: access control, training, data security, and platform and infrastructure protection.

## Key areas

- Identity and access management (MFA, least privilege)
- Awareness and training
- Data security and encryption
- Protection of platforms and networks
